<title>BELGIUM: EU sugar officials await French syrup aid proposal.</title>
<headline>EU sugar officials await French syrup aid proposal.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union sugar officials postponed a decision on aid to producers of sugar syrup in French overseas departments, an EU official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;There was a discussion and the Commission said it would prepare a final proposal, probably in time for the meeting of the sugar management committee on December 18,&quot; the official said after the committee met on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
